{
  "description": "Live Engine v2 shared transition vectors (issue #306, docs/domain/LIVE_ENGINE_V2.md §2 C3). Consumed verbatim by pytest (tests/test_live_engine_vectors.py) and vitest (webapp-frontend/tests/liveEngineVectors.test.ts). Expectations are hand-derived from the contract, not generated. Time is integer ms. Step ops: apply (project to at, then advance event at at — the canonical replay step), advance (raw advance, no projection), project (to now), timeline, clamp. 'expect' is a deep subset match (objects: listed keys only; arrays: exact length and order).",
  "plans": {
